Create project
    -> flutter create project_name
    -> flutter create --org com.example yourapp_project_name
    -> delete unnecessary flavors (windows, macos, linux etc)

Run project
    -> flutter run

Change App Name on device
    https://medium.com/@vaibhavi.rana99/change-application-name-and-icon-in-flutter-bebbec297c57
    For Android:
        android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
        change android:label
    For IOS:
        ios/Runner/Info.plist and change below
        <key>CFBundleName</key>
        <string>your_app_name</string>
